OL,3,GNEWSA'Full circle' moments as New Vic
OL,4,Amarks 40 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FAvailable for over a year
OL,8,FA small Staffordshire theatre which
OL,9,Fmade history as Europe's first
OL,10,Fpurpose-built theatre-in-the-round has
OL,11,Fbeen marking 40 years of innovative
OL,12,Fperformances.
OL,14,FThe New Vic Theatre in
OL,15,FNewcastle-under-Lyme officially opened
OL,16,Fon 13 August 1986 and was supported by
OL,17,Fa public appeal which raised more than
OL,18,F#1m in donations.
