OL,3,GNEWSA'Full circle' moments as New Vic
OL,4,Amarks 40 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the years since it has hosted 580
OL,7,Fplays, and has seen Ben Kingsley,
OL,8,FFreddie Jones, Bob Hoskins and Robert
OL,9,FPowell tread the boards.
